  "final_span": "time, the Mafia secretly tries to eliminate the Town players by voting them off. It is paramount that the Town players remain united to achieve success in combating the Mafia. The Town's success is evident in the number of players from their roster who move on. Repeatedly joining and dying allows players to experience the game nonstop and typically enhances their enjoyment. The Mafia Boss edition, similar to any other, accommodates up to 23 players. When the number of remaining players falls below 4, the winner is declared promptly - or earlier if game triggers like killing traps or specific conditions are activated. All player profiles and stats are then preserved. Personal accounts encompass nicknames, avatars, and a distinct password. Various player profiles can exist. Throughout the game, participants can establish mailboxes that are preserved for each person individually. These contain features like avatars and documents. Expanded \"macros\" for standard welcome messages enable straightforward communication with participants. Warning: The Mafia Boss application relies on Macros to save personalized data files for certain game modifications, which might decrease available storage space. Free online support is offered, along with a forum for further questions.\n\"\"Mafia\"\" in your pocket \u0096 whenever you want to play or is playing somebody else you always get the current state and your roles information right at your finger tips! \u0095 Record group members and role assignments \u0095 Send \"Preview Invitation\" requests \u0095 Keep useful information for your next meetings \u0095 Eliminate \"Monopoly and time consuming\" game sessions \"Time freezes are no fun!\" C. Foers\n\"\"Send/Get Invitation\" \u0096 let the fun start \u0095 Keep the whole data in one very clean and clear file\"\"Mafia\"\" in your iPhoneStore\nMafia, in no greater quantity, in no lesser measure.\nAmazing. Anymore stars?!\nno its free. but if you want to send mor invites you pay a few bucks\n- fixed a bug that shows duplicate lines of the logs when they are not blocked by any other players. ALSO, FIXED A ISSUE WHERE GAME Priorities ARE IGNORED.\n- bug fix only\n- fixed a bug where deleting documents didn't work properly.\n- it now shows who changes the roles",
  "break_point": null
